// Copy to secrets.h. secrets.h is gitignored.
//
// These are optional now. The device provisions itself over a setup network
// and a web page, and NVS owns the credentials from then on — so the ordinary
// way to set this up is to leave both of these empty, flash, and join the
// PIXELBAR-XXXX network the panel tells you about.
//
// Filling them in is a development convenience: on a device with nothing
// stored they are written to NVS once, at first boot, so a board on the bench
// comes up on the network already. They are a seed and not an override —
// anything set from the web page afterwards wins, and stays won across a
// reflash. Changing them here will not move a device that has already been
// provisioned; use "Forget this network" on the page for that.
#pragma once

#define PIXELBAR_WIFI_SSID ""
#define PIXELBAR_WIFI_PASS ""
